  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Plant 1,000 fruit trees in Mozambique</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ESMABAMA plans to plant 1,000 fruit trees in the co-managed schools in the South of Sofala Province, Mozambique, improving food security, fighting climate change and creating income for the community in the region. The fruit trees will also benefit the students&apos; families and the communities (more than 300,000 people estimated).</narrative>
